      test {\ifstrequal{#2}{Event}}          or test {\ifstrequal{#2}{Evento}}         or %
      test {\ifstrequal{#2}{Promoting Org.}} or test {\ifstrequal{#2}{Org. Promotora}} or %
      test {\ifstrequal{#2}{Partner Inst.}}  or test {\ifstrequal{#2}{Inst. Parceira}} or %
      test {\ifstrequal{#2}{Institution}}    or test {\ifstrequal{#2}{Instituição}}    or %
